\subsection{Real-world results}
Results are in \cref{fig:real}, with 20 trials per task. On seen tasks, LLM-backbone methods outperform RT-1 and Diffusion Policy, and UP-VLA is competitive or best. On unseen-object grasping, UP-VLA-RT-2 outperforms UP-VLA-phi-w/o-mmu, and UP-VLA is best overall, indicating semantic gains from MMU and its alignment with actions. On precision tasks, UP-VLA-phi-w/o-mmu outperforms UP-VLA-RT-2 and UP-VLA is best, highlighting the benefit of future prediction for spatial detail.

